window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A dead man on the beach. A detective with everything to prove. And a secret that won't stay buried.</p> <p>When a man’s body washes up on the North Yorkshire coast with a gunshot wound to the chest, DCI Tom Raven is handed the case. The only clue to the victim’s identity? A ring engraved with two names.</p> <p>Raven hasn’t set foot in Scarborough for over thirty years. Now he’s back – leading a murder investigation and facing ghosts from his past.</p> <p>The trail leads to an old friend turned shady businessman. But the deeper Raven goes, the more tangled the lies become – and the less he can trust the people around him.</p> <p>Not everyone wants him solving this case. And not everyone wants him back.</p> <p>Scarborough holds secrets. And someone will kill to keep them hidden.</p> <p>Set on the North Yorkshire coast, the Tom Raven series is perfect for fans of David J Gatward, J M Dalgliesh, Simon McCleave, and British crime fiction.</p>"; 
